B.Wq=new A.dL("inspect-dishwasher-leak","Look at the door seal and visible sink hose","Look at the gasket and, if you can see it, the hose under the sink. Do not split a sealed tub or pump. Unplug before you later pull the unit. No live electrical testing.","Wipe the door gasket and look for food stuck in the fold, or a drip at the bottom of the door. Under the sink, look at any visible dishwasher hose nut for a drip. Do not open a sealed cabinet or pump.","The door gasket looks clean and dry, and any visible sink hose stays dry.","Water drips at the door gasket, or a visible hose nut under the sink is wet.","dishwasher","dishwasher-door-seal-leak",B.aew,B.fW,"dishwasher-door-seal-leak")
